The German text frontend in this directory is a Rust port of parts of
Articulino-DE-EN-Realtime-Stream-TTS, Copyright 2026 eigenhand,
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0 (https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0).

Ported or copied from that project:
  - frontend/german.py
  - frontend/data/abbreviations.json
  - frontend/data/units.json

The rules and tables arrive with the modules that use them. The German number
words in number_words.rs are written from scratch to follow the convention the
upstream model was trained with.
